ThoxWebby — Thox.ai LLC — 2026
==============================

This project ("ThoxWebby") is a rebrand + THOX product integration of the
upstream Space `webml-community/gemma-4-webgpu-kernels`, which uses model weights
from `google/gemma-4-E2B-it-qat-mobile-transformers`.

Component-level licensing
-------------------------

1. Model weights (Gemma 4 E2B QAT Mobile Transformers) are published by Google
   and governed by the Gemma license as stated on the upstream model card:
   https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-4-E2B-it-qat-mobile-transformers

2. WebGPU compute kernels and the pre-compiled inference bundle
   (`gemma-4-e2b.js`) originate from the upstream Space
   `webml-community/gemma-4-webgpu-kernels`. Attribution to the original authors
   (Fable 5, xenova / webml-community) is preserved as-is.

3. THOX-authored files in this repository — the rebranded `index.html`, this
   `LICENSE`, the `README.md`, the THOX system prompt, THOX color tokens, and
   THOX product wiring — are Copyright (c) 2026 Thox.ai LLC and are provided
   AS-IS, WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT
   LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR
   PURPOSE, AND NONINFRINGEMENT.

Independence
